---
import SectionLayout from "../../layouts/SectionLayout.astro";
import { sectionMeta } from "../../lib/navigation";

const meta = sectionMeta["admision"];
---

<SectionLayout title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <!-- Admisión steps overview -->
  <div class="mb-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <a href="/admision/requisitos" class="group light-card p-6">
      <div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gold-100 text-gold-600">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.403 12.652a3 3 0 0 0 0-5.304 3 3 0 0 0-3.75-3.751 3 3 0 0 0-5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0-3.751 3.75 3 3 0 0 0 0 5.305 3 3 0 0 0 3.75 3.751 3 3 0 0 0 5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0 3.751-3.75Zm-2.546-4.46a.75.75 0 0 0-1.214-.882l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.137-.089l4-5.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-green-900 group-hover:text-gold-700">Requisitos</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">Documentos y condiciones necesarias para ingresar al CRUV.</p>
      <span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-gold-700">
        Ver requisitos
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" class="h-3 w-3"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 8a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h8.69L8.22 4.03a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06l3.22-3.22H2.75A.75.75 0 0 1 2 8Z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a href="/admision/proceso" class="group light-card p-6">
      <div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gold-100 text-gold-600">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 3.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3.5 2h9A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 14 3.5v11.75A2.75 2.75 0 0 0 16.75 18h-12A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 2 15.25V3.5Zm3.75 7a.75.75 0 0 0 0 1.5h4.5a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.5h-4.5Zm0 3a.75.75 0 0 0 0 1.5h4.5a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.5h-4.5ZM5 5.75A.75.75 0 0 1 5.75 5h4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75.75h-4.5A.75.75 0 0 1 5 8.25v-2.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-green-900 group-hover:text-gold-700">Proceso de Admisión</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">Guía paso a paso del proceso de ingreso a la universidad.</p>
      <span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-gold-700">
        Ver proceso
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" class="h-3 w-3"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 8a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h8.69L8.22 4.03a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06l3.22-3.22H2.75A.75.75 0 0 1 2 8Z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a href="/admision/fechas-importantes" class="group light-card p-6">
      <div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gold-100 text-gold-600">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.75 2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75V4h7V2.75a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0V4h.25A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 18 6.75v8.5A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 15.25 18H4.75A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 2 15.25v-8.5A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 4.75 4H5V2.75A.75.75 0 0 1 5.75 2Zm-1 5.5c-.69 0-1.25.56-1.25 1.25v6.5c0 .69.56 1.25 1.25 1.25h10.5c.69 0 1.25-.56 1.25-1.25v-6.5c0-.69-.56-1.25-1.25-1.25H4.75Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-green-900 group-hover:text-gold-700">Fechas Importantes</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">Calendario con las fechas clave del proceso de admisión.</p>
      <span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-gold-700">
        Ver calendario
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" class="h-3 w-3"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 8a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h8.69L8.22 4.03a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06l3.22-3.22H2.75A.75.75 0 0 1 2 8Z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a href="/admision/preguntas-frecuentes" class="group light-card p-6">
      <div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gold-100 text-gold-600">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 1 1-16 0 8 8 0 0 1 16 0ZM8.94 6.94a.75.75 0 1 1-1.061-1.061 3 3 0 1 1 2.871 5.026v.345a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-.5c0-.72.57-1.172 1.081-1.287A1.5 1.5 0 1 0 8.94 6.94ZM10 15a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-green-900 group-hover:text-gold-700">Preguntas Frecuentes</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">Respuestas a las dudas más comunes sobre el ingreso al CRUV.</p>
      <span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-gold-700">
        Ver FAQ
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" class="h-3 w-3"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 8a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h8.69L8.22 4.03a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-4.5 4.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06l3.22-3.22H2.75A.75.75 0 0 1 2 8Z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA — dark island for contrast -->
  <div class="rounded-2xl bg-green-900 p-8 text-center shadow-lg">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-gold-400">¿Listo para ser parte del CRUV?</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/60">
      Consulta los requisitos y comienza tu proceso de admisión hoy.
    </p>
    <a href="/admision/proceso" class="btn-gold mt-4 inline-flex">
      Iniciar proceso
    </a>
  </div>
</SectionLayout>
